feature function set_block > Place the given block at the current position.
  authors: Aksiome, theogiraudet
  created: 2024/12/30 1.21.4
  updated: 2026/09/19 26.3

  context position > position to place the block at
  input arguments: {
    block: string > block to place
    mode?: string > destroy, keep, replace or strict, defaults to replace
  }
  output $placed


feature function set_id > Replace the block id at the current position, preserving its state and NBT.
  authors: Aksiome, theogiraudet
  created: 2024/12/30 1.21.4
  updated: 2026/09/19 26.3

  context position > position to place the block at
  input arguments: {
