feature function emit_particle > Emit the block particle of the given block.
  authors: Aksiome, theogiraudet
  created: 2025/10/06 1.21.9
  updated: 2026/09/19 26.3

  context position > reference position
  input arguments: {
    block: $block_state > block whose particle to emit
    position?: string > position to create the particle at, defaults to ~ ~ ~
    delta?: string > random spread in blocks, defaults to 0 0 0
    speed?: double > speed of the particle, defaults to 1
    count?: int @ 0.. > number of particles to spawn, defaults to 1
    mode?: string > normal or force, defaults to normal
    viewers?: string > players who should see the particle, defaults to @a
  }
  output state > the particle is emitted


